{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s43ExpressibleByExtendedGraphemeClusterLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s33ExpressibleByUnicodeScalarLiteralP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/SH","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/init(_:)"],"title":"Initializers"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/character"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/clear","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/delete","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/deleteForward","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/downArrow","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/end","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/escape","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/home","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/leftArrow","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/pageDown","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/pageUp","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/return","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/rightArrow","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivalent\/space","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/KeyEquivale